{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Title: Snow Flower</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Content: Visual Novel Game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbAbout the Translation Patch</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A volunteer has kindly created an English translation patch.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Please refer to the Community Hub.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u203bThis is because we cannot include external links on the store page.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u203bWe do not provide support for the translation patch here.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbSynopsis</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Takeru, a high school student living a balanced life while working part-time as a designer in the city, is forced to move to a remote mountain village covered in snow. Unaccustomed to mountain life, he spends his days complaining about wanting to return to the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But there, he encounters his childhood friend, who is earnestly striving to address the problems facing the mountains\u2500\u2500.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbGame Overview</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The scenario is a linear path with no branching, offering about 2-3 hours of content. There are no character voices. A key feature is that illustrations progress almost entirely through still images, without using character portraits. (See product images)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbRegarding Gameplay Videos</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel free to create them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2834490?t=1767105750","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834490/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767105750","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834490/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767105750","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834490/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767105750","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Title: Snow Flower</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Content: Visual Novel Game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbAbout the Translation Patch</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A volunteer has kindly created an English translation patch.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Please refer to the Community Hub.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u203bThis is because we cannot include external links on the store page.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u203bWe do not provide support for the translation patch here.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbSynopsis</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Takeru, a high school student living a balanced life while working part-time as a designer in the city, is forced to move to a remote mountain village covered in snow. Unaccustomed to mountain life, he spends his days complaining about wanting to return to the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But there, he encounters his childhood friend, who is earnestly striving to address the problems facing the mountains\u2500\u2500.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbGame Overview</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The scenario is a linear path with no branching, offering about 2-3 hours of content. There are no character voices. A key feature is that illustrations progress almost entirely through still images, without using character portraits. (See product images)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbRegarding Gameplay Videos</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel free to create them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you.</p>","developers":["\u659c\u5854\u30bd\u30f3\u30d6\u30ec\u30ed"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834490/header.jpg?t=1767105750","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2834490/660930/0c3f9ccc3385df50ff3a43f78a30934e908a9a99/1750945913/dash_av1.mpd?t=1707826072","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2834490/660930/0c3f9ccc3385df50ff3a43f78a30934e908a9a99/1750945913/dash_h264.mpd?t=1707826072","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2834490/660930/0c3f9ccc3385df50ff3a43f78a30934e908a9a99/1750945913/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1707826072","id":257000158,"name":"\u30d7\u30ec\u30a4\u52d5\u753b","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257000158/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1707826072"}],"name":"\u4e0d\u9999\u306e\u82b1 - Snow Flower","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"\u4e0d\u9999\u306e\u82b1 - Snow Flower - $2.99 USD","packageid":1011604,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":" ","price_in_cents_with_discount":299}],"title":"Buy \u4e0d\u9999\u306e\u82b1 - Snow Flower"}],"packages":[1011604],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 Home 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 800 MB available space</l